{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Most of the people on deck scramble to attention, but one individual in a fancier uniform steps forward to meet your eyes. \"What are you doing on my ship? I don't take lightly to any somebody with a little promotion coming and trying to pull rank on my troops.\"","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:06:50.288000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-19T09:06:57.096000Z","id":"877841026805563442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"863362543585329162","content":"Bo glares. \"I'm not here to pull rank... I'm here to find out if one of your 'troops' is a spy.\" Bo glares back. \"An inspection... And you're questioning it... Are you hiding something yourself perhaps?\" He points in the direction of ferrytown. \"I LOST FRIENDS OUT THERE!\" His anger rages. Lucy hears him, and her fear grows. Passing it on to the soldiers still.","created_at":"2021-08-19T09:13:48.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877842780595056670","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
